 <h3><u>Maula mehdi aa jaiye</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Al- ajal, al-ajal, al-ajal, al-ajal</p> 
  <p>muntazir kab talak mai rahu ae imaam<br> meri saanse kahi ho na jaye tamaam</p> 
  <p>Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye..(2)</p> 
  <p>Deedar ki aakhri aas mai<br> Deedar ki aakhri aas mai<br> Khat likh raha hai ye khadim tumhe</p> 
  <p>Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
  <p>1. Kijiye qabool aqa mera salaam<br> Bas ek azadar hai mera naam<br> Qabeel nahi janta hun magar<br> kehta hun khud ko tumhara ghulam<br> Kya hun mujhe khud ye batlaiye</p> 
  <p>Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
  <p>2. Faryaad e aur istaghase huzoor<br> Sarkaar sunte to honge zaroor<br> Bechain khud bhi hai ghaibat me aap<br> Kab hoga mola batadein zahoor<br> Humko na ab or tadpaiye<br> Maula Mehdi aa jayiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
  <p>3. Be noor kab se mere nain hai<br> Tanha azadaar e behrain hai<br> Kabaa ho ya ke ho Karbobala<br> Sab aapke gham mai bechain hai<br> Sarkaar tashreef le aaiye<br> Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
  <p>4. Lafzo se parda hatati nahi<br> Apna ta’aruf karati nahi<br> Jab se gaye aap khamosh hai<br> Aayat ma’ani batati nahi<br> Raaz e Alif laam samjhaiye<br> Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
  <p>5. Tarteeb marbut ho baat se<br> Zahir jalalat ho aayaat se<br> Kehta hai zoq e talawat mera<br> Likha jo Maula ne khud haath se<br> Mujko wo quraan padhwaiye<br> Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
  <p>6. Karni hai taskheer sham aap ko<br> Lana hai haq ka nizaam aap ko<br> Aye waris e zulfiqaar e Ali<br> Lena hai jab intaqaam aapko<br> Gazi ko bhi saath le aaiye<br> Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
  <p>7. Hum jamkaraan or sehlaa gaye<br> ashko se apne arize likhe<br> Girya kiya or namaze padhi<br> Jo the jatan, basme sab karliye<br> Har jah guzarish thi, aa jaiye<br> Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
  <p>8. Khat apna karta hun is par tamaam<br> Hai mir bhi aap ka ek ghulaam<br> Hai sibt e jafar ki bhi iltija<br> Kije talab ab hame ya imam<br> Ya aap tashreef le aaiye<br> Maula Mehdi aa jaiye, Maula Mehdi aa jaiye</p> 
